==Battleground==
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*8 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Youcan]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[M. Ost]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't that hard due to the negative synergy between M. Ost and Youcan: M. Ost will Knockback and Slow [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], meaning Youcan's Wave Attacks won't do much. The stage's startoff also gives you loads of time to prepare, meaning you'll have plenty of money throughout the battle. Use units like [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Mystic Uril]] and [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]], and either the [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast Cannon]] or a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] such as [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|The Kitty of Liberty]] for Youcan's [[Barrier]].

Do not use [[:Category:Cats with Curse ability|units that can Curse]] M. Ost, such as Mystic Uril's [[True Form]] or [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]], as it will cause your Octopus Cat to walk up to Youcan and die.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Gravi (Uber Rare Cat)|Gravolodon]]: Extremely helpful due to his Wave Immunity, Relic and Alien targeting and Knockback and Curse Immunity, as well as Barrier Breaker.

==Trivia==
*Based on its Japanese name, Hotel Kachōfūgetsu (ホテル花鳥風月, "Hotel Wonders of Nature"), a likely reason why all of Wonders of Nature's enemies are birds is that 花鳥風月 ''kachōfūgetsu'' (wonders of nature) contains the kanji for bird (鳥).

